   528	asymptotic soft leg coincide; in the general class the same division leaves
   529	$2\mathfrak{a}_{\mathrm{leg}}$ (D24(d)3b). Symmetry alone does not prove the theorem: the current has an
   530	orthogonal contact component, and what makes it subleading in the two-body
   531	sector is energy-shell matching plus $C^1$ regularity of the on-shell
